1. Definitions

"Official Repository" means:
https://github.com/duoxini/pscanvasfix

"Official Release files" means release assets published by the copyright
holder from the Official Repository.

"Covered Materials" means every portion of the source code, documentation,
images, project assets, and Official Release files for which the copyright
holder owns or controls the relevant rights. Third-party materials are not
Covered Materials and remain governed by their own terms.

"Standalone Work" means the PsCanvas Classic project or a fork or modified
version whose product purpose is to provide PsCanvas Classic functionality
under its own project identity, artifact or package, installation entry, and
license notices. It must not form a feature, component, library, plugin,
feature pack, or bundled part of another product.

"Integrated Product" means any other application, module, plugin, framework,
toolkit, library, service, firmware, project, or product into which any Covered
Materials or a substantial portion of them are copied, ported, adapted, merged,
embedded, linked, bundled, or otherwise incorporated in source or object form.

"Corresponding Source" means the source code, project assets, build scripts,
and configuration used to produce a distributed object form, including changes
to those items. It excludes signing secrets; unmodified general-purpose
dependencies available from a public source; standard JDK, SDK, NDK, Gradle,
AGP, and Kotlin toolchains; and operating-system or framework components.

